---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import img2026075 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-07-5.jpeg'
import img2026071 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-07-1.jpeg'
import img2026051 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-05-1.jpeg'
import img2026052 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-05-2.jpg'
import img2026041 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-04-1.jpeg'
import img2026074 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-07-4.jpg'
import img2026073 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-07-3.jpg'
import img2026072 from '../../assets/images/testimonials/2026-07-2.jpg'
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="Testimonials - European Ordination Program"
  description="Participants from across Europe describe why they ordained, what the training asked of them, and what changed once they returned to lay life.">
  <div class="container mt-5">
    <div class="display-1 text-center py-5">
      Testimonials
    </div>
    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-lg-2 g-4">
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026075}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Portrait of Heiko Elswyk"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Heiko Elswyk</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              11th European Ordination Program participant
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-07-5/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026071}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Portrait of Jay Mutsuddi"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Jay Mutsuddi</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              11th European Ordination Program participant
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-07-1/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026051}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Monk meditation"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">My month as a Buddhist monk has made me mentally richer</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              Allan Chemnitz talks about his path to being ordained as a monk in Thailand, about physical exertion and
              about gratitude for life.
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-05-1/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026052}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Buddist monk"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Next step? Maybe a month of training in Thailand</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              Kris (52) from Lede has already been ordained as a Buddhist monk for the fifth time.
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-05-2/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026041}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Portrait of Cas"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Cas</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              Trapped in his early twenties by constant negative thoughts, and a deep sense of meaninglessness that left him
              at rock bottom, turned to self-improvement and meditation, which released years of tension and helped him
              disidentify from his overactive mind. This led him to quit his comfortable life in the Netherlands, move to a
              remote Thai jungle monastery, and become a Buddhist monk for four months to fully immerse himself to find
              lasting peace and clarity.
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-04-1/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026074}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Portrait of Enevald Horve"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Enevald Horve</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              11th European Ordination Program participant
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-07-4/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026073}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Portrait of Martin Boonsanoh"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Martin Boonsanoh</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              11th European Ordination Program participant
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-07-3/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <Image
            class="card-img-top"
            src={img2026072}
            widths={[400, 640, 900]}
            sizes="(min-width: 992px) 46vw, 94vw"
            format="webp"
            alt="Portrait of Gino Nérèo"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title">Gino Nérèo</h3>
            <p class="card-text">
              11th European Ordination Program participant
            </p>
            <a href="/testimonials/testimonial/2026-07-2/" class="btn btn-primary">Read more</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
